  - m_Id: 722079744
    m_Localized: Defense
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 793382912
    m_Localized: Negates the opponent's attack this turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72098723270656
    m_Localized: Breakthrough
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72098777796608
    m_Localized: 'Ignores the opponent''s Normal Skill: Defense.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72943439319040
    m_Localized: Degeneration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72943439319041
    m_Localized: When this piece dies while under Degeneration, create one allied
      Jellu [Pawn] on an adjacent empty square. It inherits the traits of the defeated
      piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16559834879627264
    m_Localized: Attack Disabled
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16559834950930432
    m_Localized: While [Attack Disabled], cannot make a move that would capture an
      enemy piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16700000000000001
    m_Localized: Taunt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16700000000000002
    m_Localized: When an adjacent ally is attacked, swap places with that ally and
      take the attack instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16720000000000001
    m_Localized: Evasion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16720000000000002
    m_Localized: When attacked, has a 50% chance to move to an adjacent empty tile
      and evade the attack. The attacker moves to the vacated tile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17388937073528832
    m_Localized: Move Disabled
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17388937149026304
    m_Localized: While [Move Disabled], this piece can only move to capture an opposing
      piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17402470121213952
    m_Localized: Ability Sealed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17402470196711424
    m_Localized: While [Ability Sealed], this piece cannot use abilities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17715458287996928
    m_Localized: Action Disabled
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17715458359300096
    m_Localized: While [Action Disabled], this piece cannot move or attack this turn.
